    * Microsoft's own shipping solutions do the same. CenterofExcellenceAuditLogs declares five
      connection references in Customizations.xml and has exactly two root components, both
      type 29:
      https://github.com/microsoft/coe-starter-kit/blob/main/CenterofExcellenceAuditLogs/SolutionPackage/src/Other/Solution.xml

  scripts/Test-SolutionPackage.ps1 fails the build if either type comes back.

  (The "_5F" spelling seen in real solutions - for example cat_5Fcustomazuredevops - is part of a
  custom connector's actual stored name, where "_" is hex-escaped as "5F". It is not a
  serialisation escape, and it does not apply to connection references.)
-->
